    "pageTitle.legal": "Terms of Service | Milli Orbis",
    "pageTitle.privacy": "Privacy Policy | Milli Orbis",
    "pageTitle.rights": "Rights | Milli Orbis",
    "pageDesc.legal": "The Terms of Service for Milli Orbis (portal + MilliDex): rules for this unofficial fan site, accounts, and MilliDex.",
    "pageDesc.privacy": "How information is handled on Milli Orbis: collected data, storage, external transmission, and deletion.",
